{"name":"Pepper Mill","hex":"#777568","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"pepper mill","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A small handheld grinder containing a supply of peppercorns for grinding fresh at the table or in the kitchen.","The Curta, a cylindrical hand-held mechanical calculator invented in the 1930s."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/pepper_mill"}],"entries":[{"title":"Burr mill","blocks":[{"text":"A burr mill, or burr grinder, is a mill used to grind hard, small food products between two revolving abrasive surfaces separated by a distance usually set by the user. When the two surfaces are set far apart, the resulting ground material is coarser, and when the two surfaces are set closer together, the resulting ground material is finer and smaller. Often, the device includes a revolving screw that pushes the food through. It may be powered electrically or manually."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/87/Poppy_seed_grinder_Jupiter_560.jpg/330px-Poppy_seed_grinder_Jupiter_560.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Burr_mill","wikidata":"Q96966430"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/48/Mlynek.jpg/330px-Mlynek.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/48/Mlynek.jpg/330px-Mlynek.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Traditional manual coffee grinder","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AMlynek.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4a/Coffee_grinder_mechanism.jpg/500px-Coffee_grinder_mechanism.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4a/Coffee_grinder_mechanism.jpg/1280px-Coffee_grinder_mechanism.jpg?utm_s